t-eUS_text","label":"ggOCh3t-eUS_text","default":"<p>Dory L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg2LGafJcso_text","label":"gg2LGafJcso_text","default":"Verified buyer"},{"type":"html","id":"gTSVppQVRPihz_text","label":"gTSVppQVRPihz_text","default":"<p><i>\"The deep ache in my hips had me at my wit's end—I couldn't even get out of my car without wincing. Two weeks after starting MenoMate, I realized I was bending down to pick things up without hesitation. The difference is night and day. I've even lost 4 pounds without changing anything else. Just remember to stay consistent with the dosage—it makes all the difference.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQD1otzcjp_text","label":"ggQD1otzcjp_text","default":"<p>Katy S.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggBfSRtuE_b_text","label":"ggBfSRtuE_b_text","default":"Verified buyer"},{"type":"html","id":"ggr_5oZrrOQ_label","label":"ggr_5oZrrOQ_label","default":"<p>Try MenoMate Now!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gwpdmMKsubLaI_text","label":"gwpdmMKsubLaI_text","default":"<p>90-Day Money-back Guarantee</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gpubOZkHVclLg_text","label":"gpubOZkHVclLg_text","default":"<p>Why Your Joints <span style=\"color:#A11CAD;\">REALLY Hurt</span> After 40</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gfiDlVIjRNdxJ_text","label":"gfiDlVIjRNdxJ_text","default":"<p>The Hidden Truth About Joint Pain Your Doctor Never Told You</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gjutyetiERQwe_text","label":"gjutyetiERQwe_text","default":"<p>Do your knees scream when you climb stairs? Do you groan when standing up from the couch? Do your wrists ache when gardening?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>This isn't just \"getting old\" - it's a hormone problem that starts in your late 30s!</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvl0YBplG0_text","label":"ggvl0YBplG0_text","default":"<p>What's REALLY Happening Inside Your Body:</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDV0xM_XuD_text","label":"ggDV0xM_XuD_text","default":"<p>Estrogen Decline</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9nfKCihSv_text","label":"gg9nfKCihSv_text","default":"<p>Your Joints Are Drying Out</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdUif0QzM__text","label":"ggdUif0QzM__text","default":"<p>When estrogen drops, your joints lose their natural lubricant. Like a car without oil, your joints grind and hurt with every move.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDJ-QYZvy-_text","label":"ggDJ-QYZvy-_text","default":"<p>Your Body Is On Fire Inside</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggmzcmBPlhJ_text","label":"ggmzcmBPlhJ_text","default":"<p>Changing hormones trigger inflammation that attacks your joints directly. This isn't normal aging - it's a specific hormone problem!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggTsBAmMsSo_text","label":"ggTsBAmMsSo_text","default":"<p>Your Weight Shifts To All The Wrong Places</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggLytWEtUsB_text","label":"ggLytWEtUsB_text","default":"<p>Hormones change where your body carries weight, putting new pressure on joints that aren't prepared for it. Meanwhile, your body's repair system slows down exactly when you need it most!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gBRefzwPsvJwl_text","label":"gBRefzwPsvJwl_text","default":"<p><strong>This is why nothing has worked for you so far.</strong> Regular joint supplements, stretching, and even rest periods DON'T FIX the real hormone problem.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6oVysJJxT_text","label":"gg6oVysJJxT_text","default":"<p><span style=\"color:#F582AE;\"><strong>THE GOOD NEWS</strong></span></p><p>When you finally fix the hormone imbalance causing your joint pain, your body can actually rebuild comfort and flexibility from the inside out!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggo8jRlfRkv_text","label":"ggo8jRlfRkv_text","default":"<p>MenoMate is the ONLY supplement specifically designed to <strong>target the hormone-joint connection that's making you hurt.</strong></p>"}],
